<title>USA: Pall drops authorization for shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Pall drops authorization for shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>EAST HILLS, N.Y. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pall Corp said Tuesday its board has withdrawn authorization for the balance of up to $40 million to buy back the company's shares.</p>
<p>Pall had already spent $10 million of the authorization.</p>
<p>The stock repurchase program had been authorized in late February.</p>
<p>Pall designs, manufactures and markets disposable filters, membranes and other fluid clarification and separation devices for the health care, aeropower and fluid processing markets.</p>
</text>
